description: "TypeScript conventions: exhaustive switches, test layout, type assertions, erasable syntax, the compiler and deploys."
globs: **/*.ts,**/*.tsx,**/*.mts
alwaysApply: false
paths:
  - "**/*.ts"
  - "**/*.tsx"
  - "**/*.mts"
